# Classroom IPv4 isolation template; interface en0. Load only in the scoped project anchor.
pass in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from 10.7.16.25 to 10.7.2.240 port 3002 flags S/SA keep state label "cn-b-edge-allow"
block return in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from any to 10.7.2.240 port 3002 label "cn-b-client-block"
